<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">No Answer Needed: Predicting LLM Answer
<br class="ltx_break">Accuracy from Question-Only Linear Probes<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>The Mentorship for Alignment Research Students program by the Cambridge AI Safety Hub.</span></span></span></h1>
