<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.2 Extended information on the direction approach ‣ Appendix A Additional results ‣ No Answer Needed: Predicting LLM AnswerAccuracy from Question-Only Linear Probes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> extends the results of the direction approach presented in Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.3.2 Training on other datasets ‣ 4.3 Correctness direction generalization ‣ 4 Experiments and Results ‣ No Answer Needed: Predicting LLM AnswerAccuracy from Question-Only Linear Probes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
